      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Need to add that the disappearance of all devices in vrc can also sometimes happen due to disconnect of device that vrchat is currently using as it happens sometimes when using a wireless HMDs.\nA workaround to that so far is to install VB-Audio VoiceMeeter and to have it's virtual audio devices set as default, and just route the audio from other devices in the system to that.\nThat way vrchat will be using default virtual audio devices and it won't bugout if something else disconnects.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
